    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a response time below 2 seconds for common queries, an availability target of 99.9%, integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), support for health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR), and compliance with regulatory requirements such as GDPR and medical confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technical stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do our propose to ensure seamless integration and high performance? our platform Atelier is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be used to address the client's needs. our have a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds for common queries, which meets the response time requirement. our availability target is also 99.9%, which aligns with the client's expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), our have standard connectors and custom adapters available for SIH and DPI integration. our also support health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR through our FHIR_HL7 connector, which is part of our health interoperability capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding regulatory compliance, our Sovereign European open-weight model is fully sovereign, auditable, and has strong grounding and citation behavior, ensuring that our can meet the requirements for GDPR and medical confidentiality. our also have a SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent available for hosting, which meets the security standards required by the client." ;
