    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure seamless integration and high performance, I propose an architecture that leverages our Atelier platform, hosted on OuraneCloud's Sovereign HDS tier, which provides the necessary security and compliance certifications. our will use our API-first approach to integrate with the existing SIH and DPI systems, ensuring a smooth flow of information between systems." ;
