        ex:hasText "Our platform Atelier ability to scale horizontally with additional inference capacity will also enable our to handle increased traffic and workload as needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our current technical stack is well-suited to meet the client's requirements, and with careful architecture and planning, our can ensure a seamless integration and high-performance solution that meets the client's needs." ;
