    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls and measures can we implement to ensure the protection of sensitive health data, and how will we demonstrate compliance with regulatory requirements such as GDPR Article 9 and the French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification?" ;
