    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As SecurityCompliance Agent at we, I can confirm that we has experience in delivering solutions that comply with GDPR, particularly for public-sector and health clients, including special-category (Art. 9) health data. we secure development lifecycle includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external CREST-equivalent provider." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the protection of sensitive health data, we will implement encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256, with key management on EU-based infrastructure. we also use pseudonymisation and data minimisation techniques to further protect sensitive information. we solution provides strict isolation between client corpora through per-engagement logical separation and Role-Based Access Control (RBAC).  we have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register, with a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) available that aligns with GDPR Art. 28. we incident response plan includes defined detection, notification, and remediation steps, with a breach notification delay of 72 hours." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate compliance with regulatory requirements such as GDPR Article 9 and the French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, we will leverage we existing ISO 27001 and ISO 27701 certifications, which cover the development, delivery, and operations of Our solution. we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, is SecNumCloud-qualified, ensuring that Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud infrastructure meets the required standards for hosting sensitive health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud are familiar with the HAS guidance on AI in healthcare and can provide control mapping that links Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud platform features to applicable obligations, with audit evidence available. control mapping that links our platform features to applicable obligations, with audit evidence available will help ensure that Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud meet the necessary regulatory and legal constraints related to personal and health data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contract must cover design, implementation, and deployment, with a focus on regulatory compliance, intellectual property rights, and liability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key legal risks associated with this project, and how will we ensure that we proposed solution complies with relevant laws and regulations, including GDPR, medical device qualification (CE marking), and MDR?" ;
