    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Legal Agent for Faber IA, I can confirm that Faber IA has experience in public procurement and compliance with regulatory requirements. the key legal risks associated with this project include ensuring GDPR compliance, particularly with regards to processing special category data, and addressing potential medical device qualification (CE marking) and MDR implications." ;
