    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate the key legal risks associated with this project, we will ensure that our proposed solution complies with relevant laws and regulations by maintaining strict adherence to we regulatory compliance obligations, which are monitored by we Security & Compliance function." ;
