    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contract will cover design, implementation, and deployment, and we will provide administrative attestations as required. we will also ensure that our proposed solution does not introduce any rupture in clinical or administrative workflows and that our proposed solution integrates with existing hospital information systems and electronic patient records." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding intellectual property rights, our Atelier platform is proprietary software owned by Faber IA, licensed to the client under a subscription/usage model for the contract term. we use open-source components with permissive licenses and provide an SBOM (Software Bill of Materials) to the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address potential medical device qualification implications, we Legal function will flag any CE/MDR implications and consequences for liability and positioning. we will also ensure that our proposed solution provides explainability and traceability, as required by EU AI Act." ;
