    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that the authority's emphasizes sovereignty constraints and wishes to limit the environmental footprint of the authority's information systems, our might propose using the sovereign HDS tier and a sovereign European model, which could be more cost-efficient." ;
