    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific measures, we can take to minimize the project's environmental impact, we can: * Use low-carbon infrastructure for hosting * Implement energy-efficient practices in Faber IA operations * Reduce e-waste by using existing equipment and recycling when possible * Promote sustainable transportation options for Faber IA employees * Continuously monitor and report on Faber IA carbon footprint to identify areas for improvement By taking these measures, we can demonstrate we commitment to CSR and sustainability while ensuring compliance with relevant regulations and standards." ;
