        ex:hasText "In conclusion, Our consortium proposes a comprehensive AI assistance solution that meets the requirements and constraints of The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB). a sovereign platform, Atelier, which can forge document-grounded AI assistants from CHRB's own documents are confident that a sovereign platform, Atelier, which can forge document-grounded AI assistants from CHRB's own documents will improve staff efficiency, patient care, and reduce costs while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and minimizing environmental impact." ;
